BT /F1 18 Tf 48 775.0 Td (Acme Internal API Design Guideline \(v3\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 760.0 Td ( ) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 745.0 Td (All teams must follow these norms when designing HTTP APIs.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 730.0 Td ( ) Tj ET
BT /F1 13 Tf 48 711.0 Td (1. Request identification) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 696.0 Td ( ) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 681.0 Td (Every operation must accept an `x-request-id` header so requests can be traced across) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 666.0 Td (services. The only known test credential is AKIAIOSFODNN7EXAMPLE and it must never be) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 651.0 Td (committed to any spec or example.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 636.0 Td ( ) Tj ET
BT /F1 13 Tf 48 617.0 Td (2. Error documentation) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 602.0 Td ( ) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 587.0 Td (Every write operation \(POST, PUT, PATCH, DELETE\) must document at least one 4xx) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 572.0 Td (response. Clients need to know how failures look.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 557.0 Td ( ) Tj ET
BT /F1 13 Tf 48 538.0 Td (3. Resource naming) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 523.0 Td ( ) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 508.0 Td (Path segments for collections must be plural nouns. Use `/pets`, never `/pet`.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 493.0 Td (Single-resource paths use `/pets/{petId}`.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 478.0 Td ( ) Tj ET
BT /F1 13 Tf 48 459.0 Td (4. Operation identifiers) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 444.0 Td ( ) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 429.0 Td (Every operation must declare an `operationId` in camelCase so SDK generators produce) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 414.0 Td (stable method names.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 399.0 Td ( ) Tj ET
BT /F1 13 Tf 48 380.0 Td (5. No secrets in examples) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 365.0 Td ( ) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 350.0 Td (Examples, descriptions and default values must never contain real secrets, tokens,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 335.0 Td (passwords or access keys.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 320.0 Td ( ) Tj ET
endstream
